# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
.parent {
  .middle {
    .nested-parent .nested-target { color: red; }
  }
}
.nested-target { color: red; }

.block {
  &--active .suffix-target { color: red; }
}
.suffix-target { color: red; }

.multi-parent {
  & & .multi-target { color: red; }
  & .multi-target { color: red; }
}

.sidebar > {
  .partial-target { color: red; }
}
.partial-target { color: red; }

.card {
  + {
    .adjacent-target { color: red; }
  }
}
.adjacent-target { color: red; }

.low,
#high {
  .list-target { color: red; }
}
.list-target { color: red; }

```

